  "prompts": {
    "states": "Create a production game animation sheet of EXACT Terraspin character in the attached reference. Preserve olive-green turtle head with small eyes and beak-like mouth, broad brown domed shell behind shoulders, tan/olive front chest plate with black oval ventilation holes, green circular chest Omnitrix, TWO long flat tapered flipper arms (no fingers), two sturdy short turtle legs with blunt toes, NO tail. Clean original-TV cartoon cel style, crisp black outlines, flat colors with one shadow tone, not painted. Exactly 8 SEPARATE full-body right-facing/three-quarter figures in a 4-column 2-row grid on truly transparent background. Each entire body, shell, flippers and toes visible, generous clear margins and gutters, no cropping. Row-major poses: 1 ultimate preparation lifting both long flippers sideways; 2 ultimate active fan stance with head visible and flippers extended diagonally in opposite directions, chest vents clear; 3 ultimate return/recovery; 4 neutral upright resting stance, flippers relaxed down; 5 guard curling flippers around front of shell; 6 upright hit recoil, not prone; 7 knocked out lying sideways, shell and head connected; 8 forward dash lean with long flippers swept backward. SAME head, shell, chest vents, colors and body scale in every frame. BODY ONLY: no wind rings, air swirls, clouds, motion streaks, floor, dust, shadows, text or labels. Desired native figure height 350-430px in 1536x1024 or higher. All animations will get separate code-generated wind effects.",
